    kind: invariant  # ff4d
    title: "SCIP Symbol.span is the identifier token, not the item (79 of 79 methods single-line on aardvark-dns); the item range is in enclosing_range, and using it makes stable_id parity hold, which the collision splitter would then undo -- gated on WI-gojum"  # ff4d
    status: violated  # ff4d
    priority: 3  # ff4d
    parent:  # ff4d
